@host = http://localhost:5000
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI
@expenseId = COLE_O_GUID_AQUI

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Registrar usuário
POST {{host}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "employee@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPassword123!"
}

### Login
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "employee@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPassword123!"
}

### Criar rascunho
POST {{host}}/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Despesa de deslocamento para cliente",
  "amount": 125.50,
  "expenseDate": "2026-09-29",
  "categoryId": null
}

### Enviar rascunho
POST {{host}}/api/expenses/{{expenseId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar conforme perfil
GET {{host}}/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar histórico
GET {{host}}/api/expenses/{{expenseId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
